{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/1f3a394f776ed94cf4f93c571c41a96d.avif?t=1762742763\" width=1024 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>Zoomageddon</strong>: a <strong>story-driven dungeon crawler shooter</strong> with a dash of <strong>playful humor</strong>. It blends chaotic bullet-heaven survival with strategic, procedurally-generated dungeons... all wrapped in <strong>gorgeous pixel art with dynamic modern lighting and a slick, colorful UI.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERVIEW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Zoomageddon happened. The world's a mess, mutant animals are everywhere, and the tyrannical Rat King is calling the shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Society's only hope? Oyen, a lone orange cat serving in the Neo-Pankou military. <strong>(He's probably just in it for the snacks.)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a simple mission to destroy a rat's nest unravels a &quot;Trail of Mysteries&quot; that will challenge everything Oyen (and you) <i>thought</i> you knew about the ancient Chinese Zodiac. Turns out, the Great Race was less of a friendly jog and <strong>more of a chaotic, backstabbing bloodsport.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/c10475e7c31efc206c58cfed44cb687d.poster.avif?t=1762742763\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/c10475e7c31efc206c58cfed44cb687d.webm?t=1762742763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/c10475e7c31efc206c58cfed44cb687d.mp4?t=1762742763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES (Playable Now in the Demo!)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern Pixel Art:</strong> Dive into a beautifully crafted pixel-art world, brought to life with dynamic modern lighting, slick shaders, and a vibrant, colorful UI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frantic Bullet-Heaven Combat:</strong> Survive against massive hordes of mutant enemies! Mow 'em down, level up, and unleash an arsenal of quirky and powerful abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally-Generated Dungeons:</strong> No two runs are the same! Crawl through ever-changing, procedurally-generated dungeon layouts. Every run is a new map filled with new challenges, secrets, and... mostly... mutants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Upgrade Your Bunker:</strong> The bunker is your customizable hub and home!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather <strong>Elemental Essences</strong> and resources in the dungeon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>Zodiac Forge</strong> to craft powerful new weapons for your arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pray to the RNG gods at the <strong>Zodiac Shrine</strong> to unlock new abilities for future runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the <strong>Training Gym</strong> for permanent, meta-progressing stat upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it home! Use the <strong>Decoration Builder</strong> to customize your personal bunker space.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story-Driven Mystery:</strong> You're not just surviving; you're investigating. Begin the &quot;Trail of Mysteries&quot; and uncover the dark truth behind the Zoomageddon and the Rat King's rise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt the Rooster Zodiac (Chapter 1 Demo):</strong> Track down, challenge, and defeat the boss of the first chapter\u2014the twisted <strong>Rooster Zodiac</strong>! The demo features the <i>first</i> of a planned <strong>5-chapter saga</strong>, each culminating in a unique Zodiac boss fight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/dc822ca2ee0e9d6fc12b69d58fa62c22.poster.avif?t=1762742763\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/dc822ca2ee0e9d6fc12b69d58fa62c22.webm?t=1762742763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/dc822ca2ee0e9d6fc12b69d58fa62c22.mp4?t=1762742763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/b35f42e98643c011b70ae77a596ec846.poster.avif?t=1762742763\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/b35f42e98643c011b70ae77a596ec846.webm?t=1762742763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/4a32822a5e4d21eaa74da9a903cd7b51.poster.avif?t=1762742763\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/4a32822a5e4d21eaa74da9a903cd7b51.webm?t=1762742763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/4a32822a5e4d21eaa74da9a903cd7b51.mp4?t=1762742763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNRAVEL THE ZODIAC CONSPIRACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rooster is just the beginning. Each of the 5 planned chapters will unravel a new piece of the conspiracy. <i>Zoomageddon</i> blends the fast-paced, &quot;one-more-run&quot; addiction of a bullet-heaven with the narrative depth and strategic planning of a dungeon crawler. Every run pushes the story forward. Every death is a chance to upgrade your bunker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to survive the Zoomageddon, expose the truth, and finally put the Rat King in his place? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play the Demo &amp; Wishlist now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/extras/9c6d81b32d38499764a6e78c0a9cf003.avif?t=1762742763\" width=616 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3274010?t=1762742763","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3274010?t=1762742763","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/c8b47f791635699bf9bfab51603086c690f8d966/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762742763","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274010/c8b47f791635699bf9bfab51603086c690f8d966/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762742763","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"contro